## Pruebas Rápidas

```bash
# 1. Login
TOKEN=$(curl -s -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"username":"admin","password":"admin"}' | jq -r .token)

# 2. Listar entidades (ejemplo: entity1s)
curl -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN" http://localhost:8080/api/entity1s

# 3. Crear registro
curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/entity1s \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"name":"Test","description":"Descripción"}'

# 4. Obtener por ID
curl -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN" http://localhost:8080/api/entity1s/<id>

# 5. Actualizar
curl -X PUT http://localhost:8080/api/entity1s/<id> \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"name":"Actualizado","description":"Nueva descripción"}'

# 6. Eliminar
curl -X DELETE -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN" http://localhost:8080/api/entity1s/<id>
```

